  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0153_f11a96477a34.png\"><br>\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& x^2+y^2-6 x-8 y+\\left(25-a^2\\right)=0 \\\\\n& \\text { Radius }=4=\\sqrt{9+16+\\left(25-a^2\\right)} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{a}=\\pm 4\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
